i","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Elsterrier is the younger twin sister of her highly esteemed and current Beltina of the Snow Festival, Caroline. Despite her own wish to be a Beltina, she isn’t as perturbed to remain under Caroline’s shadow. But Caroline’s larger bust size is a significant concern. Els is the more \"grounded\" of the two and takes care of her older sister in practical matters like doing house chores and grocery shopping. El’s Beltina dance is flawless in technique but does not have \"feeling\" in it. She is also Kazuki's classmate with excellent grades."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1545"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖ベルティナ学院に通う主人公のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現役の『エルディス・ベルティナ』の一人である"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キャロライン・マリーゴールドの妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"努力家タイプで美貌と教養を兼ね備え、しっかり者で人当たりがよく面倒見もよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で周囲から将来を期待されているが、本人は目標である姉と自分を常に比べて自己研鑽を怠らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院では男子にも人気であるが、自分の夢である"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉を追いかけるのに精一杯で、恋をする余裕はなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は胸の小ささを気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祭具は杖で『アスティリア』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はじめはお姉ちゃんに憧れて見た夢だったの。でも今は違う。これは私の……私自身の夢」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13620","sourceWorkId":"13572","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖ベルティナ学院に通う主人公のクラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現役の『エルディス・ベルティナ』の一人である キャロライン・マリーゴールド の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"努力家タイプで美貌と教養を兼ね備え、しっかり者で人当たりがよく面倒見もよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で周囲から将来を期待されているが、本人は目標である姉と自分を常に比べて自己研鑽を怠らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院では男子にも人気であるが、自分の夢である姉を追いかけるのに精一杯で、恋をする余裕はなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は胸の小ささを気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祭具は杖で『アスティリア』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はじめはお姉ちゃんに憧れて見た夢だったの。でも今は違う。これは私の……私自身の夢」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20933"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13620","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13620","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13620","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13620","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13620","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56c932874fe092b2152476281f1335513f47eef539c9e92b16a92b8c3472cc95.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfacdb48b80c4567db1af599bb8869ab2267308a401e49387a54a4f08ea70eb7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水愛","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:5953:20933:4064:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1547","characterName":"土岐遠 カスミ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20934","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"5953"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13621"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1547"},"originalCharacterName":"土岐遠 カスミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"418"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kasumi is Kazuki’s older cousin and acts like his big sister. She is usually the school’s model student, but reveals a playful and spoiled side when around Kazuki. As Algester said before, she is very attractive to girls even to the point of giving love letters. She holds a close relationship to Gin but seems oblivious as to what possible implications could entail. Kasumi is currently the strongest dancer and regarded as the favorite to be the next Beltina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1547"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の従姉。聖ベルティナ学院に通う上級生で、既にベルティナの資格を持っており若手の舞い手として期待されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は大人びた風貌でプロモーションがよく、内面は面倒見がよくて頼れるお姉さんとして男女問わず人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際のところはかなりやんちゃな性格なのだが、それは子供の頃から遊んでいた一騎ぐらいしか知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"付き合いの長い一騎はカスミに油断を見せないようにしているが、カスミには弱点を知り尽くされている為いつもいじり倒されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は『エルディス・ベルティナ』のキャロラインの元で修行中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キャロラインのことは『エルディス・ベルティナ』として尊敬してる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祭具は中華風の扇子で『エバーグリーン』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ネコかぶってるなんて、人聞きが悪いわね。大人になったと言いなさいな」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13621","sourceWorkId":"13572","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の従姉。聖ベルティナ学院に通う上級生で、既にベルティナの資格を持っており若手の舞い手として期待されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は大人びた風貌でプロモーションがよく、内面は面倒見がよくて頼れるお姉さんとして男女問わず人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際のところはかなりやんちゃな性格なのだが、それは子供の頃から遊んでいた一騎ぐらいしか知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"付き合いの長い一騎はカスミに油断を見せないようにしているが、カスミには弱点を知り尽くされている為いつもいじり倒されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は『エルディス・ベルティナ』のキャロラインの元で修行中。キャロラインのことは『エルディス・ベルティナ』として尊敬してる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祭具は中華風の扇子で『エバーグリーン』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ネコかぶってるなんて、人聞きが悪いわね。大人になったと言いなさいな」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20934"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13621","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13621","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"167 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13621","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13621","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13621","sourceWorkId":"13572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bba254f46c65b1582f52f47bfe4c9316cff50f2fe30dfff45021fccbcaaf5680.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae9eb1627e32c29fab9a8ce9976f2d47423e2c6d7fe346393b8b578aa8a6ad87.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅川悠","creatorId":"vndb:s81","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s81","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s81","name":"浅川 悠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:5953:20934:3958:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1548","characterName":"リア・ベルリオーズ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20935","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"5953"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13622"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1548"},"originalCharacterName":"リア・ベルリオーズ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"602"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lia is Elsterrier’s spunky, approachable best friend. She’s optimistic, speaks her mind, and easy to talk to. As the head of the newspaper club, she has connections and will be the first to know what’s the gossip around the island. She has a part-time job at a dusty, shut-in library and Kazuki sometimes help out whenever he needs cash. Coffee is the main drink there. When Lia sets her mind onto something, she will pursue it till the very end. Her Beltina dance is expressive and passionate but lacks control."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From m3rryweather's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1548"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖ベルティナ学院に通う主人公のクラスメイトであり、臨時バイト先の同僚でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"はっちゃけ策士、エルステリアの参謀、『日陰の才媛、奸智の申し子』を自称する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし実態は、陰謀や策謀は大好きなのだが、いつも失敗している暴走気味のトラブルメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも本人は気にせず元気に別の策謀を巡らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルステリアと仲がよく、学院内でも有名コンビ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は特に『エルディス・ベルティナ』を目指しているわけではないが、「エルスといると楽しい」という理由から進路をエルスに合わせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目指すものを持っているエルスを眩しく見つめながら、自分自身のことはなかなか分からないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祭具はリング状で『アルカンシエル』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふん、飛んで火に入る夏の虫たぁあんたのことじゃっ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13622","sourceWorkId":"13572","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":fals